  <p>
    A music collection on your hard drive but no player installed, or one that nags you with ads, forced accounts and cloud sync? The KodiniTools Ultimate Music Player plays local audio files directly in your browser. Drop a folder in, press play, done. Shuffle, repeat and a visualizer that makes the beat visible are included.
  </p>

